# =============================================================================
# Trivy ignore file for the datari-docs image
# =============================================================================
#
# Required by .github/workflows/deploy-nks.yml — the trivy-action treats every
# path listed in `trivyignores:` as mandatory and fails when one is missing,
# so each build context needs its own ignore file (it can be empty when there
# are no accepted-risk CVEs for that image).
#
# Add a CVE id on its own line, preceded by a comment block that records:
#   * the vulnerable component and version
#   * the upstream fix version
#   * a re-check date for periodic review
